{"entries":[{"id":"rgirshick-2408.00714","sourceId":"rgirshick","sourceName":"罗斯·吉尔希克 · Meta AI","title":"SAM 2: Segment Anything in Images and Videos","titleZh":"SAM 2：在图像和视频中分割一切","published":"2024-08-01T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1722470400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/rgirshick-2408.00714/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/edba9413e6e3f9b2.webp","summary":"SAM 2 is a foundation model for promptable visual segmentation in images and videos, achieving better accuracy with fewer interactions and faster speed.","summaryZh":"SAM 2 是一个基础模型，用于图像和视频中的可提示视觉分割，以更少的交互和更快的速度实现了更好的准确性。"},{"id":"rgirshick-2305.05665","sourceId":"rgirshick","sourceName":"罗斯·吉尔希克","title":"ImageBind: One Embedding Space To Bind Them All","titleZh":"ImageBind：一个嵌入空间绑定所有","published":"2023-05-09T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1683590400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/rgirshick-2305.05665/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/c0e0054d8ecd62a4.webp","summary":"ImageBind learns a joint embedding across six modalities using only image-paired data, enabling zero-shot cross-modal transfer.","summaryZh":"ImageBind 仅使用图像配对数据学习六种模态的联合嵌入，实现了零样本跨模态迁移。"},{"id":"rgirshick-2304.02643","sourceId":"rgirshick","sourceName":"罗斯·吉尔希克 · Meta AI","title":"Segment Anything","titleZh":"分割一切","published":"2023-04-05T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1680652800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/rgirshick-2304.02643/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/8956b56b4815b8d3.webp","summary":"We introduce Segment Anything, a promptable segmentation model and the largest dataset (SA-1B) with 1B masks on 11M images, achieving impressive zero-shot performance.","summaryZh":"我们提出了分割一切项目，包括一个可提示的分割模型和迄今为止最大的分割数据集（SA-1B），包含 11M 张图像上的 10 亿个掩码，其零样本性能令人印象深刻。"},{"id":"rgirshick-1911.05722","sourceId":"rgirshick","sourceName":"罗斯·吉尔希克 · Facebook AI Research (FAIR)","title":"Momentum Contrast for Unsupervised Visual Representation Learning","titleZh":"动量对比：用于无监督视觉表示学习","published":"2019-11-13T00:00:00.000Z"