/8ca892467f46b641.webp","summary":"Fast R-CNN achieves faster training and testing speeds with higher accuracy for object detection.","summaryZh":"Fast R-CNN 在目标检测中实现了更快的训练和测试速度以及更高的准确率。"},{"id":"rgirshick-1311.2524","sourceId":"rgirshick","sourceName":"罗斯·吉尔希克 · UC Berkeley","title":"Rich feature hierarchies for accurate object detection and semantic segmentation","titleZh":"用于精确目标检测和语义分割的丰富特征层次结构","published":"2013-11-11T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1384128000000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/rgirshick-1311.2524/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/b9ed147c908ef64d.webp","summary":"R-CNN combines region proposals with CNNs to achieve a 30% relative improvement in mAP on PASCAL VOC 2012.","summaryZh":"R-CNN 将区域提议与 CNN 结合，在 PASCAL VOC 2012 上实现了 mAP 相对提升 30%。"}]}